WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.542
♪

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:02.252
Danny: I just thought it was a coincidence.

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.628
Rya: Danny, are you really willing

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:04.796
to take the blame for this?

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:06.715
♪

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:07.424
Tom: Danny Sullivan

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:09.342
is on trial for a serious crime.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:10.677
Police: Come out with your hands up.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.595
Tom: He is someone with good intentions.

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:14.431
Tom: But he is a kid who is lost.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.432
♪

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:18.226
Tom: Danny is not from a strong background.

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:19.018
Girl: Loser.

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:21.062
Akiva: He yearns to be normal,

00:00:21.062 --> 00:00:22.188
like any teenager.

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.357
Akiva: But he struggles and is suffering.

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.942
Bill: I'm going to kick you're little wirey ass.

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:27.026
Danny: I'm so sorry

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:27.777
Danny: Please! Please!

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:30.363
♪

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.531
Yitzhak: You want to come in, clean yourself up?

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.074
♪

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:35.410
Tom: Our whole show is a mystery.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.745
Rya: What about the girl?

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:37.746
Matty: No sign of her either.

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:39.122
I'm thinking that he offed her.

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:41.833
Amanda: Rya Goodwin is a professor

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.793
Amanda: She's passionate about her job.

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:44.627
♪

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:46.880
Amanda: She's a way into Danny's psyche.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.256
Amanda: She's trying to save his life.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:48.798
[Knocking]

00:00:48.798 --> 00:00:50.258
Rya: Do you know where she is, Danny?

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:52.177
Danny: I keep telling you, I don't know where she is.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:54.220
♪

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.889
Tom: It is a twisting tale,

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.140
a psychological thriller.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.725
Tom: It's a show like no other.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.185
Matty: Do you think these are all victims?

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:02.145
Akiva: Paradigms continue to swing

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:04.105
back and forth like a pendulum.

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:05.231
Danny: What do you want me to say?

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.025
Danny: That this whole thing was a setup from the start.

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.067
Rya: What if it was?

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.695
♪

00:01:10.695 --> 00:01:11.946
Tom: I hope that people are gripped.

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:12.614
♪

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:13.948
Tom: I hope that people are shocked. 

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:15.116
Philip: He's hiding something.

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:16.117
Rya: If I'm right,

00:01:16.117 --> 00:01:17.368
Danny may be innocent.

00:01:17.368 --> 00:01:18.787
Rya: Danny.

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:20.580
Where did they all go?

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:25.084
♪

